Networking-journey

Documenting hands-on labs and configs for CCNA, MCSE, Firewall and Server Administration.

🛠️ Skills Practiced

*Networking - CCNA*
- Router Configuration: Static, OSPF, EIGRP
- Switch Configuration: VLANs, Trunking, STP
- ACLs, NAT, DHCP
- Tools: Packet Tracer, GNS3

*Server - MCSE*
- Active Directory: Domain Controller, OU, GPO, Users/Groups
- Windows Server: DNS, DHCP, File Server
- Hyper-V
- *Workstation Setup:* Windows 10/11 Installation, Domain Join, User Profile Config, Software Deployment via GPO

*Security*
- Firewall rule configuration
- Cisco ACL implementation
- VPN Labs

